## -----------------------------------------
## .NET Core / ASP.NET Core Specifics
## -----------------------------------------
# Build folders and artifacts
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Log]s/
TestResults/

# User-specific project settings and local overrides
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# ASP.NET Core User Secrets (Keep your local secrets out of source control)
# Stored globally by default, but if mapped locally:
.microsoft.dotnet.secretmanager/

# Hot Reload / Roslyn specific caching
.analyzerdata/

